<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56001" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατοικ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>habitation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρβάρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hecat.
					119
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος εὐφυὴς πρὸς κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.78.5
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑγιεινὴν ποιεῖν τὴν κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					5.4.8
				</span></i>
			; <i>farm, village</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.32.4
			</span></i>, etc.: generally, <i>dwelling-place,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Act.Ap.
				17.26
			</span></i>; <i>domicile</i>, Mitteis <i><span class="en">
				<u>Chr.</u>
				31 i 23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>settlement, colony</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.4.11
			</span></i>; esp. of <i>military colonies</i> in Egypt, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				61
			</span></i>(b).<i><span class="en">
				227
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, etc.; also, = Lat.
			<i>colonia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.2.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				16
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				5.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατοικίαι πόλεων</span>
			foundation of <i>colonies</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				47
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>body of residents in</i> a foreign <i>city</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κ. τῶν ἐν Ἱεραπόλει κατοικούντων
					Ἰουδαίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IGRom.</u>
					4.834
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
